+#: src/sparql/geosparql.md:18
 msgid ""
-"`purrdf-geo` (`purrdf::geo` from the umbrella crate) implements GeoSPARQL "
-"1.1 (OGC 22-047r1) for PurRDF: exact, float-free geometry reached from "
-"SPARQL through the evaluator's two existing extension seams. It parses "
-"`geo:wktLiteral` and `geo:geoJSONLiteral` lexical forms into an exact "
-"geometry model, decides the OGC topological relations over that model, "
-"computes the non-topological accessors, measures and constructors, and hands "
-"the `geof:` family to a host as scalar-function registrations and the "
-"spatial relations as property-function registrations. There is no GEOS and "
-"no PROJ behind it — the DE-9IM engine, WKT and GeoJSON are implemented in-"
-"crate, in pure Rust, which is what lets it build for `wasm32-unknown-"
-"unknown`."
+"The standard geographic profile assigns unprefixed WKT, OGC CRS84 and "
+"GeoJSON to WGS84 longitude followed by latitude. Original decimal "
+"coordinates remain exact rationals. Longitude outside `[-180, 180]` and "
+"latitude outside `[-90, 90]` refuse before conversion; valid inputs are "
+"never wrapped or clamped."
 msgstr ""
-"`purrdf-geo`（在总括 crate 中为 `purrdf::geo`）为 PurRDF 实现了 GeoSPARQL 1.1"
-"（OGC 22-047r1）：精确、不含浮点的几何，经由求值器现有的两个扩展点从 SPARQL "
-"到达。它把 `geo:wktLiteral` 与 `geo:geoJSONLiteral` 的词法形式解析为精确的几"
-"何模型，在该模型上判定 OGC 拓扑关系，计算非拓扑的访问器、度量与构造器，并把 "
-"`geof:` 函数族作为标量函数注册、把空间关系作为属性函数注册交给宿主。它背后没"
-"有 GEOS，也没有 PROJ——DE-9IM 引擎、WKT 与 GeoJSON 都在 crate 内以纯 Rust 实"
-"现，正因如此它才能为 `wasm32-unknown-unknown` 构建。"
+"标准地理配置将无前缀 WKT、OGC CRS84 和 GeoJSON 解释为 WGS84，坐标顺序为经度、"
+"纬度。原始十进制坐标保持为精确有理数。经度超出 `[-180, 180]` 或纬度超出 "
+"`[-90, 90]` 时，在转换前拒绝；有效输入绝不被环绕或钳位。"
 
-#: src/sparql/geosparql.md:32
-msgid "It mints no vocabulary"
-msgstr "它不生成任何词汇"
+#: src/sparql/geosparql.md:23
+msgid ""
+"EPSG:4326 requires an explicit WGS84 latitude/longitude registration. Other "
+"references, units and operation chains require caller registrations. An "
+"ellipsoid does not establish a datum transformation, and the engine does not "
+"guess zones, height, epoch, control points or regional transformation "
+"parameters. Standard OGC terms have their published meanings; application "
+"namespaces and custom registrations remain caller supplied."
+msgstr ""
+"EPSG:4326 要求显式注册 WGS84 纬度/经度顺序。其他参考系、单位和操作链也必须由"
+"调用方注册。指定椭球并不等于指定基准转换；引擎不会猜测分带、高程、历元、控制点"
+"或区域转换参数。标准 OGC 术语遵循其已发布含义；应用命名空间和自定义注册仍由"
+"调用方提供。"
+
+#: src/sparql/geosparql.md:30
+msgid ""
+"[`Geographic profiles and requests`](https://github.com/Blackcat-Informatics/"
+"purrdf/blob/main/docs/GEO-PROFILE.md) specifies the versioned JSON records, "
+"reference axes, operation parameters, limits, identity rules and every host "
+"entry."
+msgstr ""
+"[`地理配置与请求`](https://github.com/Blackcat-Informatics/purrdf/blob/main/"
+"docs/GEO-PROFILE.md) 规定了带版本的 JSON 记录、参考坐标轴、操作参数、限制、"
+"身份规则及各个宿主入口。"
 
