+#: src/sparql/geosparql.md:36
 msgid ""
-"GeoSPARQL's IRIs are OGC's, not PurRDF's. Every IRI the crate reads or "
-"writes — the two literal datatypes, the `geof:` function names, the `geo:` "
-"spatial relations, the Simple Features geometry classes, and the coordinate "
-"reference system a WKT literal omits — is supplied by the caller through "
-"`GeoVocab`, which has no `Default` and never will. A term that is absent "
-"makes the feature that needs it a hard error, never a fabricated fallback."
+"The default `NativeSparqlEngine` installs the immutable standard `geof:` "
+"functions. Registering a conflicting standard function is a hard error "
+"before execution. A query selects additional bindings and independent "
+"numerical limits with `QueryOptions::with_geo`:"
 msgstr ""
-"GeoSPARQL 的 IRI 属于 OGC，而不属于 PurRDF。该 crate 读取或写出的每一个 IRI——"
-"两个字面量数据类型、`geof:` 函数名、`geo:` 空间关系、Simple Features 几何类，"
-"以及 WKT 字面量省略时所指的坐标参考系——都由调用方通过 `GeoVocab` 提供，而它没"
-"有 `Default`，将来也不会有。缺少某个术语，会使需要它的功能成为硬错误，绝不会"
-"得到一个编造的后备值。"
+"默认 `NativeSparqlEngine` 安装不可变的标准 `geof:` 函数。注册与标准函数冲突的"
+"函数，会在执行前产生硬错误。查询通过 `QueryOptions::with_geo` 选择附加绑定"
+"及独立的数值限制："
 
