+#: src/sparql/geosparql.md:63
 msgid ""
-"`functions::register` installs every `geof:` function into a "
-"`UserFunctionRegistry` under the vocabulary's function namespace. The engine "
-"binds the registry with `NativeSparqlEngine::bind_functions`, and the bound "
-"registry is handed to a query through `QueryOptions::with_functions`:"
+"Geographic `metricDistance`, `metricLength`, `metricPerimeter`, `metricArea` "
+"and `metricBuffer`, and their explicit-unit counterparts, use the declared "
+"ellipsoid. Projected metre systems retain their planar law. Length includes "
+"polygon boundaries and preserves the declared mixed-dimension rule; area "
+"subtracts holes and squares unit factors. Z and M are retained without "
+"inventing an elevation."
 msgstr ""
-"`functions::register` 把每一个 `geof:` 函数安装到一个 `UserFunctionRegistry` "
-"中，挂在该词汇表的函数命名空间下。引擎用 "
-"`NativeSparqlEngine::bind_functions` 绑定该注册表，绑定后的注册表经由 "
-"`QueryOptions::with_functions` 交给查询："
+"地理 `metricDistance`、`metricLength`、`metricPerimeter`、`metricArea`、"
+"`metricBuffer` 及其显式单位版本使用声明的椭球。以米为单位的投影系统保留其平面"
+"法则。长度包含多边形边界，并保留声明的混合维度规则；面积扣除孔洞，并对单位换算"
+"因子取平方。Z 和 M 得到保留，不会凭空生成高程。"
 
-#: src/sparql/geosparql.md:72
+#: src/sparql/geosparql.md:70
 msgid ""
-"// Every `geof:` function is a native closure, so binding parses nothing.\n"
-msgstr "// 每一个 `geof:` 函数都是原生闭包，因此绑定时不解析任何内容。\n"
+"Malformed arguments and geometric domain errors retain SPARQL expression-"
+"error behavior. Operational precision, work, memory, convergence, "
+"cancellation and floating-environment failures remain fatal through `FILTER` "
+"and `BIND`. Governed evaluation retains its original incomplete-outcome and "
+"work evidence. The direct geographic request API preserves the same typed "
+"causes instead of turning a refused invocation into an empty result."
+msgstr ""
+"格式错误的参数和几何定义域错误保留 SPARQL 表达式错误行为。精度、工作量、内存、"
+"收敛、取消和浮点环境方面的运行故障，即使经过 `FILTER` 和 `BIND` 仍是致命错误。"
+"受治理的求值保留原有未完成结果和工作证据。直接地理请求 API 保留相同的类型化"
+"原因，不会将被拒绝的调用转成空结果。"
+
