+"接受 `--geo-profile`。"
 
-#: src/sparql/geosparql.md:147
+#: src/sparql/geosparql.md:126
 msgid ""
-"An asserted `geo:sfWithin` triple matches whether or not the geometries "
-"satisfy it — the rewrite rules are entailments, not definitions — and a "
-"relation the index refutes contributes no row beyond what the data asserts."
+"A semantic refusal has a complete response record. An operational refusal "
+"keeps its original failure channel and creates no unadmitted response under "
+"the failed invocation. Prepared data is immutable and shareable; live "
+"numerical contexts stay thread bound. Native storage is admitted before "
+"birth and retained until its actual payload is destroyed."
 msgstr ""
-"断言的 `geo:sfWithin` 三元组无论几何是否满足它都会匹配——重写规则是蕴涵，而不"
-"是定义——而索引所否定的关系，除数据所断言的之外，不贡献任何行。"
+"语义拒绝具有完整响应记录。运行拒绝保留原始失败通道，且不会在失败调用下创建"
+"未经准入的响应。预备数据不可变且可共享；活动数值上下文仍绑定在线程上。原生"
+"存储在创建前取得准入，并保留至实际载荷销毁为止。"
 
-#: src/sparql/geosparql.md:151
-msgid "Every answer is exact, and identical on every target"
-msgstr "每个答案都是精确的，并且在每个目标上都相同"
-
-#: src/sparql/geosparql.md:153
+#: src/sparql/geosparql.md:132
 msgid ""
-"Geometry is where floating point normally destroys reproducibility: `f64` "
-"addition is not associative, so a different traversal order gives a "
-"different answer, and a native build and a wasm32 build can disagree about a "
-"predicate that sits near a boundary. This crate closes that channel rather "
-"than mitigating it."
+"Frozen numerical, geometry and hierarchy transcripts compare completed "
+"native and WebAssembly answers. The public GeodTest collector checks the "
+"complete 500,000-row source by digest, while allocator, backend and host "
+"fixtures check their separate contracts. Mathematical derivations and "
+"exactness boundaries are recorded in [`Geodesic numerics`](https://"
+"github.com/Blackcat-Informatics/purrdf/blob/main/docs/design/purrdf-geodesic-"
+"numerics.md) and [`Geometry exactness`](https://github.com/Blackcat-"
+"Informatics/purrdf/blob/main/docs/design/purrdf-geo-exactness.md)."
 msgstr ""
-"几何正是浮点通常破坏可复现性的地方：`f64` 加法不满足结合律，因此不同的遍历顺"
-"序会给出不同的答案，而原生构建与 wasm32 构建可能会在一个靠近边界的谓词上产生"
-"分歧。本 crate 关闭了这一通道，而不是缓解它。"
-
-#: src/sparql/geosparql.md:159
-msgid ""
-"**Coordinates are read as exact rationals.** A lexical decimal is parsed "
-"digit by digit into an exact numerator and denominator; nothing is rounded "
-"on the way in."
-msgstr ""
-"**坐标以精确有理数读取。** 词法上的十进制数按位解析为精确的分子与分母；读入时"
-"不做任何舍入。"
-
-#: src/sparql/geosparql.md:162
-msgid ""
-"**Every geometric decision is integer arithmetic.** Orientation, segment "
-"intersection, point-in-ring, ring winding and the DE-9IM matrix are "
-"comparisons of exact rationals over arbitrary-precision integers, which Rust "
-"specifies completely and identically on every target."
-msgstr ""
-"**每一个几何判定都是整数运算。** 方向、线段相交、点在环内、环的绕向以及 "
-"DE-9IM 矩阵，都是基于任意精度整数的精确有理数比较，而 Rust 对这些运算在每个目"
-"标上都有完整且相同的规定。"
-
-#: src/sparql/geosparql.md:166
-msgid ""
-"**Irrational measures are integer square roots** at a fixed internal scale, "
-"summed as integers — one rounding, at the end, of a value that was exact "
-"until then."
-msgstr ""
-"**无理数度量是整数平方根**，在固定的内部尺度上计算，并以整数求和——只在最后对"
-"一个此前一直精确的值做一次舍入。"
-
-#: src/sparql/geosparql.md:169
-msgid ""
-"**The single float boundary is the result literal.** An `xsd:double` result "
-"is the correctly rounded nearest double, computed with integer arithmetic "
-"and assembled with `f64::from_bits`. The crate root denies "
-"`clippy::float_arithmetic`, so there is no second float path to find."
-msgstr ""
-"**唯一的浮点边界是结果字面量。** `xsd:double` 结果是正确舍入后最接近的 "
-"double，以整数运算计算，并用 `f64::from_bits` 组装。crate 根禁止 "
-"`clippy::float_arithmetic`，因此不存在可被找到的第二条浮点路径。"
-
-#: src/sparql/geosparql.md:174
-msgid ""
-"Native Rust pins the complete geometry corpus against committed digest "
-"bytes. `make wasm` separately builds the crate for the WASM target."
-msgstr ""
-"原生 Rust 测试按已提交的摘要字节固定完整几何语料。`make wasm` 单独为 WASM 目"
-"标构建 crate。"
-
-#: src/sparql/geosparql.md:177
-msgid "What is here, and what is not"
-msgstr "有什么，没有什么"
-
-#: src/sparql/geosparql.md:179
-msgid ""
-"Implemented: the WKT and GeoJSON codecs (with CRS and coordinate-dimension "
-"support); every topological relation of the Simple Features, Egenhofer and "
-"RCC8 families over an exact DE-9IM; the accessors; and the measures and "
-"constructors that are exactly computable."
-msgstr ""
-"已实现：WKT 与 GeoJSON 编解码器（支持 CRS 与坐标维度）；基于精确 DE-9IM 的 "
-"Simple Features、Egenhofer 与 RCC8 各族的每一个拓扑关系；访问器；以及可精确计"
-"算的度量与构造器。"
-
-#: src/sparql/geosparql.md:184
-msgid ""
-"Registered but **hard-erroring by name**: the operations that would require "
-"facilities the crate deliberately does not have — a coordinate-reference-"
-"system database for `geof:transform`, and an ellipsoidal geodesic for the "
-"`metric*` family. They are never silently absent and never answer a default. "
-"A topological predicate that returned `false` because it was unimplemented "
-"would be indistinguishable from one that returned `false` because the "
-"geometries genuinely do not relate, and that is the failure this crate "
-"exists to keep out."
-msgstr ""
-"已注册但**点名报硬错误**：那些需要本 crate 有意不具备的设施的操作——"
-"`geof:transform` 所需的坐标参考系数据库，以及 `metric*` 函数族所需的椭球大地"
-"线计算。它们绝不会静默缺席，也绝不会返回默认值。一个因未实现而返回 `false` 的"
-"拓扑谓词，将无法与一个因几何确实不相关而返回 `false` 的谓词区分开来，而这正是"
-"本 crate 存在所要杜绝的失败。"
-
-#: src/sparql/geosparql.md:192
-msgid ""
-"Like the full-text index, this is a Rust-host seam: the registrations are "
-"host closures and do not cross the Python, WebAssembly or C boundary. The "
-"full exactness accounting is [`docs/design/purrdf-geo-exactness.md`](https://"
-"github.com/Blackcat-Informatics/purrdf/blob/main/docs/design/purrdf-geo-"
-"exactness.md)."
-msgstr ""
-"与全文检索索引一样，这是一个 Rust 宿主扩展点：这些注册是宿主闭包，不跨越 "
-"Python、WebAssembly 或 C 边界。完整的精确性说明见 [`docs/design/purrdf-geo-"
-"exactness.md`](https://github.com/Blackcat-Informatics/purrdf/blob/main/docs/"
+"冻结的数值、几何和层次运行记录比较已完成的原生与 WebAssembly 答案。公开 "
+"GeodTest 收集器按摘要检查完整的 500,000 行源数据；分配器、后端和宿主测试分别"
+"检查各自的契约。数学推导和精确性边界记录于 [`测地线数值方法`](https://github."
+"com/Blackcat-Informatics/purrdf/blob/main/docs/design/purrdf-geodesic-numerics.md) "
+"和 [`几何精确性`](https://github.com/Blackcat-Informatics/purrdf/blob/main/docs/"
 "design/purrdf-geo-exactness.md)。"
 
